3. **Digit processing logic** (only if all characters are digits):
   - For each digit at position `i`, it reads the next character (at `i+1`) — but note: this may go out of bounds if not handled carefully.
   - Converts current digit (`s[i]`) and next char (`s[i+1]`) to integers.
   - Calls a helper function `second_question_function(current_digit, s[i+1] + i)`.
